<title>USA: Western Water names Simon CFO.</title>
<headline>Western Water names Simon CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Water Co said Thursday that it has named Ronald Simon chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Simon was previously managing director and chief financial officer of Henley Group Inc.</p>
<p>In November, Western Water said it had named Edward Beeman CFO.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available for further comment.</p>
</text>
